OL,3,GNEWSAMental health nurse struck off for
OL,4,Amisconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mental health nurse has been struck
OL,7,Foff after a misconduct hearing found
OL,8,Fher actions caused a patient physical
OL,9,Fand emotional harm.
OL,11,FThe Nursing and Midwifery Council found
OL,12,FLancashire nurse Kay Mitchell's fitness
OL,13,Fto practice to be impaired due to her
OL,14,Factions against a patient and a
OL,15,Fcolleague in 2022 in two separate
OL,16,Fincidents.
OL,18,FMitchell did not attend the
OL,19,Ffitness-to-practise committee's
OL,20,Fhearing, which ruled to prevent her
OL,21,Ffrom practicing in order to protect the
OL,22,Fpublic.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
