OL,5,
OL,6,FThe committee found she had acted in a
OL,7,Fmanner that was unprofessional and/or
OL,8,Fabusive towards a patient, as well as
OL,9,Fencouraging a staff member to contact
OL,10,Fsomeone to commit violence against a
OL,11,Fcolleague.
